Alternative for <a href="#expireAfterSeconds()"><code>expireAfterSeconds()</code></a> to configure the timeout after which the document should expire.
Defaults to an empty <a class="external-link" href="https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html" title="class or interface in java.lang"><code>String</code></a> for no expiry. Accepts numeric values followed by their unit of measure:
<ul>
<li><b>d</b>: Days</li>
<li><b>h</b>: Hours</li>
<li><b>m</b>: Minutes</li>
<li><b>s</b>: Seconds</li>
<li>Alternatively: A Spring template expression. The expression can result in a
<a class="external-link" href="https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Duration.html" title="class or interface in java.time"><code>Duration</code></a> or a valid expiration <a class="external-link" href="https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html" title="class or interface in java.lang"><code>String</code></a> according to the already mentioned
conventions.</li>
</ul>
Supports ISO-8601 style.

<pre class="code">@Indexed(expireAfter = "10s") String expireAfterTenSeconds;
@Indexed(expireAfter = "1d") String expireAfterOneDay;
@Indexed(expireAfter = "P2D") String expireAfterTwoDays;
@Indexed(expireAfter = "#{@mySpringBean.timeout}") String expireAfterTimeoutObtainedFromSpringBean;
</pre>

items.translation:
替代<a href="#expireAfterSeconds()"><code>expireAfterSeconds()</code></a>的配置选项，用于设置文档过期的超时时间。默认值为空<a class="external-link" href="https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html" title="class or interface in java.lang"><code>String</code></a>，表示不过期。接受数值及其单位：
<ul>
<li><b>d</b>: 天</li>
<li><b>h</b>: 小时</li>
<li><b>m</b>: 分钟</li>
<li><b>s</b>: 秒</li>
<li>或者：一个 Spring 模板表达式。该表达式的结果可以是<a class="external-link" href="https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Duration.html" title="class or interface in java.time"><code>Duration</code></a>，或者是符合上述约定的有效过期<a class="external-link" href="https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html" title="class or interface in java.lang"><code>String</code></a>。</li>
</ul>
支持 ISO-8601 格式。

<pre class="code">@Indexed(expireAfter = "10s") String expireAfterTenSeconds;
@Indexed(expireAfter = "1d") String expireAfterOneDay;
@Indexed(expireAfter = "P2D") String expireAfterTwoDays;
@Indexed(expireAfter = "#{@mySpringBean.timeout}") String expireAfterTimeoutObtainedFromSpringBean;
</pre>

