Index name either as plain value or as <a class="external-link" href="https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html" title="class or interface in org.springframework.expression.spel.standard"><code>template
expression</code></a>. <br/>
<br/>
The name will only be applied as is when defined on root level. For usage on nested or embedded structures the
provided name will be prefixed with the path leading to the entity. <br/>
<br/>
The structure below

<pre><code>
@Document
class Root {
  Hybrid hybrid;
  Nested nested;
}

@Document
class Hybrid {
  @Indexed(name="index") String h1;
  @Indexed(name="#{@myBean.indexName}") String h2;
}

class Nested {
  @Indexed(name="index") String n1;
}
</code>
</pre>

resolves in the following index structures

<pre><code>
db.root.createIndex( { hybrid.h1: 1 } , { name: "hybrid.index" } )
db.root.createIndex( { nested.n1: 1 } , { name: "nested.index" } )
db.hybrid.createIndex( { h1: 1} , { name: "index" } )
db.hybrid.createIndex( { h2: 1} , { name: the value myBean.getIndexName() returned } )
</code>
</pre>

items.translation:
索引名称可以是纯值，也可以是 <a class="external-link" href="https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html" title="class or interface in org.springframework.expression.spel.standard"><code>模板表达式</code></a>。<br/>
<br/>
当在根级别定义时，名称将原样应用。对于嵌套或嵌入结构的使用，提供的名称将加上指向该实体的路径作为前缀。<br/>
<br/>
以下结构

<pre><code>
@Document
class Root {
  Hybrid hybrid;
  Nested nested;
}

@Document
class Hybrid {
  @Indexed(name="index") String h1;
  @Indexed(name="#{@myBean.indexName}") String h2;
}

class Nested {
  @Indexed(name="index") String n1;
}
</code>
</pre>

解析为以下索引结构

<pre><code>
db.root.createIndex( { hybrid.h1: 1 } , { name: "hybrid.index" } )
db.root.createIndex( { nested.n1: 1 } , { name: "nested.index" } )
db.hybrid.createIndex( { h1: 1} , { name: "index" } )
db.hybrid.createIndex( { h2: 1} , { name: the value myBean.getIndexName() returned } )
</code>
</pre>
